                <pb facs="0060" n="40" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v02/pg40"/>

                <head>21. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On January 13, 1962, the Joint Chiefs of Staff transmitted to Secretary McNamara
                    JCSM-33-62, which in 14 numbered paragraphs stated the strategic importance of
                    the Southeast Asia mainland. For text, see <hi rendition="#italic">United
                        States-Vietnam Relations, 1945-1967</hi>, Book 12, pages 448-454.</p>
            </div>
